  "details": "Currently on load the Avatar Wing menu doesn't retain the previous settings you had open. For example, if I have the \"Uploaded\" section filtered by Date Uploaded it won't retain this information.\nhttps://i.imgur.com/B14x5M8.png\nInstead when I load my game and open the menu it will  open up to \"Favorites\" and have everything unfiltered.\nhttps://i.imgur.com/1sLdyfI.png\nThen if I go to the Uploaded menu the settings are still wrong.  \nhttps://i.imgur.com/PhImk7Q.png\nThe behavior I expect is that when I have a certain filter/selection made on the wing menus that it retains that information between loads.",
